{
  "name": "656. DeepSeek turns thinking off for a forced tool choice only when no reasoning level was asked (deepseek thinking off)",
  "description": "Local fixture regression for TXE-8011 (Bifrost-Tokun contract C4), no live provider calls. Start tests/e2e/api/runners/provider-error-fixture.mjs, start an isolated gateway on tests/e2e/api/provider_config/provider-error-fixture.config.json, and run with providerErrorFixture=1; every case is skipped otherwise. DeepSeek rejects thinking with a forced tool_choice, and the DeepSeek provider turned thinking off before the chat converter ran, so a requested reasoning level was dropped without a judgement (the converter then failed on the extra param the provider had injected, blaming the caller). The rule now runs inside the converter: with no level asked, thinking is turned off (656.4); with a level, the request is refused with 400 caller_unsupported_parameter on reasoning.effort before anything reaches DeepSeek, unary (656.2) and streamed (656.3). own_deepseek is a custom provider on the deepseek base, answered by /pp/ownkey. 656.5 and 656.6 pin the other refusal the cross-provider check found: Perplexity's own converter dropped reasoning.max_tokens sent without an effort (its request takes reasoning_effort only), so the budget is now refused with 400 caller_unsupported_parameter on reasoning.max_tokens, unary and streamed, before anything reaches the fixture.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "656.1 fixture counters and recorded requests reset",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('counters cleared', function () { pm.expect(j.data[0].reset, pm.response.text()).to.equal(true); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{providerErrorFixtureUrl}}/__reset"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "656.2 [EXPECT-400] reasoning_effort high with a forced tool choice is refused on DeepSeek before any upstream call (deepseek thinking off)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('refused with 400', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code, pm.response.text()).to.equal(400); });",
              "var j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('error_type is caller_unsupported_parameter', function () { pm.expect((j.extra_fields || {}).error_type, pm.response.text()).to.equal('caller_unsupported_parameter'); });",
              "pm.test('error.param names reasoning.effort', function () { pm.expect((j.error || {}).param, pm.response.text()).to.equal('reasoning.effort'); });",
              "pm.sendRequest({ url: pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixtureUrl') + '/__wire', method: 'GET' }, function (err, res) {",
              "  pm.test('the fixture reports what reached it', function () { pm.expect(err, String(err)).to.equal(null); pm.expect(res.code).to.equal(200); });",
              "  var calls = res.json().data[0].calls.filter(function (c) { return c.path.indexOf('/pp/ownkey/') === 0 && c.body.indexOf('txe-8011-high') !== -1; });",
              "  pm.test('nothing reached the vendor', function () { pm.expect(calls.length, res.text()).to.equal(0); });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"own_deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"txe-8011-high\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tools\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"function\",\n      \"function\": {\n        \"name\": \"lookup\",\n        \"parameters\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tool_choice\": \"required\",\n  \"reasoning_effort\": \"high\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "chat",
            "completions"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
